.<br/>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le16ob01re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sweet! How did it go?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ah, I was nervous. I really think I let my nerves get the best of me.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No way! I have no doubt that you did well. I definitely think they're going to hire you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I hope so. This would be a great start to my career as a journalist.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm pretty sure you'll get the job, but if you don't, you might want to consider becoming a food critic.", "id": 2, "time": "9500", "image": "engenn5le16ob01re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Of course, and then I can write about your restaurant and its wonderful dishes.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Cute, but the way I see it, I won't open up my own restaurant anytime soon. I may move back to Cambridge.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: When will you come back?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I might come back in a few months.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That'd be great!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: But only if you'll promise to help me write my cookbook.", "id": 3, "time": "35500", "image": "engenn5le16ob01re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally Gets a Job at a Magazine"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Working at a Magazine?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le16ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Will, May, Might"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Future tense (<span class=\"strong\">will</span>) to talk about actions you in the future. You can also use the modals <span class=\"strong\">might</span> and <span class=\"strong\">may</span> to talk about possible actions in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The auxiliary <span class=\"strong\">will</span> goes before the verb. The short form is \u2018ll.<br/><br/> You use the Future tense when you talk about the future, make offers or make predictions.<br/><br/>The modals <span class=\"strong\">might</span> and <span class=\"strong\">may</span> go before the verb.<br/> <br/>They talk about future possibility or a chance that something will happen.<br/> <br/><span class=\"strong\">Might</span> means there is a smaller chance that something will happen (30%).<br/> <br/><span class=\"strong\">May</span> means there is a slightly greater chance that something will happen (50%)."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I might write a cookbook. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will move back to Boston next year.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "They may open a restaurant. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use these expressions to express an opinion:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I think\u2026</span><br/><br/> <span class=\"italic\">In my opinion\u2026</span><br/><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I'm pretty sure\u2026</span><br/><br/> <span class=\"italic\">The way I see it\u2026</span><br/><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I have no doubt that..</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I really think I did well. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have no doubt that you got the job. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The way I see it they'll definitely hire you. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "magazine"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large thin book that contains news stories, articles and photographs"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll work for a magazine. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "freelance "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "work independently for a company "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I applied for a freelance position. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "journalist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who writes for newspapers or magazines "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This job is the first step in becoming a journalist. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hire"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to employ someone to do a specific job "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They are going to hire you as their new writer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "start "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the beginning of someone's job, which they will develop in the future "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This will be a great start to my career."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "food critic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone whose job is to make judgments about the dishes served in restaurants "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You love to eat food, you should become a food critic. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to open up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make available to the public "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I might open up a restaurant in the city."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find 4 crazy jobs. Write them down in the table below. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read about them. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "What's your opinion about each of them? Write 2-3 sentences for each job. Remember to use an expression to introduce your opinion"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your opinions with a partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Job \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"My Opinion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research different jobs on the internet. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write down my opinion about different jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I introduce my opinion using an expression."}]}], "type": "sena"}